%%{init: {"theme":"base","themeVariables":{"fontFamily":"Arial, sans-serif","fontSize":"16px"}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    actor Client
    box rgba(219,234,254,0.45) Application
        participant Controller
        participant Service as CountryService
        participant Adapter as SOAP adapter
    end
    box rgba(255,237,213,0.45) External SOAP service
        participant SOAP as CountryInfoService
    end
    box rgba(220,252,231,0.45) Database
        participant MySQL
    end

    Client->>Controller: POST /api/v1/countries {name: kenya}
    Note over Controller: Validate input. Invalid request returns 400
    Controller->>Service: lookupAndStore(kenya)
    Note over Service: Sentence-case name to Kenya
    Service->>Adapter: getCountryIsoCode(Kenya)
    Adapter->>SOAP: CountryISOCode(sCountryName)
    SOAP-->>Adapter: KE or not-found text
    Adapter-->>Service: ISO code KE
    Service->>Adapter: getFullCountryInfo(KE)
    Adapter->>SOAP: FullCountryInfo(sCountryISOCode)
    SOAP-->>Adapter: Name, capital, phone, continent, currency, flag, languages
    Adapter-->>Service: FullCountryInfoData
    Note over Adapter,Controller: No ISO code raises CountryNotFoundException and returns 404
    Note over Service,MySQL: DB transaction starts after both SOAP calls
    Service->>MySQL: Find by ISO, save country and replace languages
    MySQL-->>Service: Persisted country
    Service-->>Controller: LookupResult
    Controller-->>Client: 201 Created for new or 200 OK for existing
